sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Exchange identity for scoped AWS credentials
accDescr: The mobile client receives an OIDC token, exchanges it with STS, and signs direct service calls with the complete temporary credential set.
participant App as Mobile app
participant IdP as OIDC provider
participant STS as AWS STS
participant Data as S3 and DynamoDB
App->>IdP: Authenticate user
IdP-->>App: OIDC identity token
App->>STS: AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity
Note over STS: Validate token and role trust
STS-->>App: Access key, secret key, session token
App->>Data: Signed request with session token
Note over Data: Enforce user-scoped role permissions
Data-->>App: Authorized result
